Cell["\<\
A finite scheme-change counterterm is generated for the Majorana mass term, \
the scalar quartic, and the Yukawa interaction. The finite counterterm for \
the gauge couplings is immediately absorbed by redefining the gauge coupling \
to retain a canonical normalization of the kinetic term of the gauge field.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1251948659,ExpressionUUID->"372c5404-68ec-485c-bb7e-eba5dce982a3"]
}, Dynamic[CurrentValue[
 EvaluationNotebook[], {TaggingRules, "Openers", "ExampleSection", "0"}, 
  Closed]]]],

